<title>USA: AMEX closing averages.</title>
<headline>AMEX closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the American Stock Exchange closed higher in moderate trading.</p>
<p>The Amex Composite index closed at 548.03, up 6.83.</p>
<p>Winners beat losers 325 to 195.</p>
<p>The average price per share was up $0.16.</p>
<p>Preliminary volume was 19,939,000 compared with 18,254,720 on Monday.</p>
<p>(Prices official as of 1630 EST/2130 GMT)</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730))</p>
